 "notes": [
  "Posted 4 August 2001 with no Coruscant-set cards, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting 8': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Operational As Planned, Moff Jerjerrod, Death Star II and Desperate Counter; these count toward the total.",
  "The list as published totals 59 cards, not 60: Characters is headed 10 but lists 9. The strategy mentions the Emperor ('Palpy in ship', 'the Emperor and his shuttle'), who may be the missing card, but he is not listed; the counts are kept as published.",
  "Posted 'Endor Operations/I don't care' dested Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost (the back side is a joke name).",
  "Posted 'DS II Central Core' dested Death Star II: Reactor Core, the only Death Star II sector besides the Coolant Shaft and Capacitors listed with it.",
  "Posted 'Endor', 'Endor Bunker', 'Endor Landing Platform', 'Death Star II', 'Kashyyyk', 'Kessel' and 'Sullust' dested the Dark pages Endor (Dark), Endor: Bunker (Dark), Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark), Death Star II (Dark), Kashyyyk (Dark), Kessel (Dark) and Sullust (Dark).",
  "Posted 'SFS 7.2' dested SFS L-s7.2 TIE Cannon and 'SFS 9.3' SFS L-s9.3 Laser Cannons; 'Chimeara' Chimaera; 'U-3P0' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Lt. Hebsly' Lieutenant Hebsly; 'Ghhhk/Those Rebels Won't Escape Us' and 'Dark Maneuvers/Tallon Roll' the Reflections II combo Interrupts.",
  "Secret Plans is the Special Edition Effect, posted under Effects.",
  "The strategy's 8/5 update swaps one Squadron (probably The Emperor's Sword) for Endor Shield; the list here is the one posted."
